1,306 tests, OK, 1 registered skip. Type check on the
changed files: 0 errors.

### Not verified in this pass

No live mailbox run: the sender experiments are local
serialization round trips, and a live restart mid-handshake
remains unproven, as do resumption over a live mailbox, a
2nd provider, and live scale beyond 1 session carrying 1
job. Resumption across a responder restart is not possible
by design (the ticket table is process memory) and the
proof record now says so. Still open, unchanged: the
idnits submission-time edits, the named hybrid slot
(X25519MLKEM768, named in Section 16.1, not implemented),
and the cold test itself.

(Correction to the counts above: the 1,306-test batch did
